WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.100
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.107 --> 00:01.177
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

3
00:01.747 --> 00:02.747
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

4
00:02.817 --> 00:03.877
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

5
00:32.077 --> 00:33.077
Sit down.

6
00:33.747 --> 00:34.747
Here.

7
00:34.817 --> 00:35.917
(Episode 20)

8
00:38.517 --> 00:39.517
Drink.

9
00:51.397 --> 00:53.127
You look incredibly handsome when you are cleaned up.

10
00:55.197 --> 00:57.767
Have you ever thought about becoming an actor?

11
01:02.207 --> 01:03.537
Has it been two weeks since we last saw each other?

12
01:05.107 --> 01:06.247
Have you been well?

13
01:08.947 --> 01:10.577
Well, for the record,

14
01:11.717 --> 01:13.887
I keep getting rejected by someone,

15
01:14.757 --> 01:15.957
so it hurts a little...

16
01:17.887 --> 01:18.987
Well, I am fine.

17
01:25.797 --> 01:27.167
Earlier at 11 o'clock,

18
01:28.237 --> 01:30.167
I had a cross-examination with Son Ji Yeol.

19
01:32.337 --> 01:33.337
I see.

20
01:35.877 --> 01:36.937
He said he was sorry,

21
01:37.507 --> 01:38.807
that he committed a grave sin,

22
01:40.277 --> 01:41.477
and that if I let him off just this once,

23
01:41.547 --> 01:43.677
he would live the rest of his life repenting and atoning.

24
01:45.617 --> 01:47.347
He was crying and begging on his knees.

25
01:47.917 --> 01:48.917
So?

26
01:50.257 --> 01:51.387
Are you going to let him off?

27
01:59.227 --> 02:00.697
I need to forgive myself first.

28
02:02.867 --> 02:04.397
I will forgive myself first,

29
02:05.067 --> 02:06.367
and once I am forgiven,

30
02:07.637 --> 02:09.537
I will think about that jerk then.

31
02:14.247 --> 02:15.817
I just slept for two whole weeks.

32
02:18.287 --> 02:19.747
Because I hated the sight of myself.

33
02:22.687 --> 02:25.087
The sound of my breathing, my talking,

34
02:25.487 --> 02:26.587
my walking.

35
02:28.057 --> 02:29.927
Every sound that proved I was alive...

36
02:30.457 --> 02:32.097
was so terribly awful to hear,

37
02:33.567 --> 02:35.067
so I just kept sleeping.

38
02:35.697 --> 02:36.697
Right.

39
02:39.767 --> 02:41.167
I have been there too.

40
02:43.307 --> 02:45.377
I felt so pathetic...

41
02:45.577 --> 02:47.147
and annoyed and irritated with myself...

42
02:47.677 --> 02:49.277
that I did not move for a whole month...

43
02:51.717 --> 02:53.747
and just slept all day.

44
02:56.717 --> 02:58.127
I had a time like that too.

45
03:03.297 --> 03:04.297
So,

46
03:05.467 --> 03:06.567
are you done sleeping?

47
03:08.297 --> 03:10.037
If you have slept enough, get up now.

48
03:13.307 --> 03:16.737
Get up, brush your teeth, wash your face,

49
03:16.937 --> 03:18.107
eat some food,

50
03:18.707 --> 03:21.447
drink some coffee, and get some sun.

51
03:22.347 --> 03:23.977
Check if the Earth is still spinning...

52
03:24.047 --> 03:26.147
and take a look at the sky like this.

53
03:29.517 --> 03:31.217
As for forgiving yourself,

54
03:31.287 --> 03:32.927
you can do that after you do all of that,

55
03:33.527 --> 03:34.957
when you have nothing else to do,

56
03:35.997 --> 03:37.127
when you have so little to do...

57
03:37.197 --> 03:38.697
that you feel like you are dying of boredom.

58
03:39.797 --> 03:40.997
Could you not do it then?

59
03:42.137 --> 03:43.697
And personally,

60
03:45.607 --> 03:46.837
that Son Ji Yeol...

61
03:47.867 --> 03:48.877
and his evil gang,

62
03:49.807 --> 03:51.007
I recommend you do not forgive them.

63
03:58.487 --> 03:59.587
Do you like pasta?

64
04:01.187 --> 04:04.557
Last night, some killer truffles came in.

65
04:05.057 --> 04:06.887
Let us grate a ton of truffles and make some pasta.

66
04:07.127 --> 04:08.657
I am not trying to show off or anything.

67
04:08.727 --> 04:09.997
No, I am showing off.

68
04:11.497 --> 04:13.427
Do you know how precious truffles are...

69
04:13.497 --> 04:14.527
as an ingredient?

70
04:16.597 --> 04:18.137
I do not think this punk knows.

71
04:21.577 --> 04:24.277
My roommate is the co-CEO and manager here.

72
04:24.377 --> 04:27.207
If he tries to pick a fight with you or glares at you,

73
04:27.277 --> 04:29.677
just ignore him. He is just tall.

74
04:29.777 --> 04:32.387
But on the inside, he is the size of a bedbug.

75
04:32.517 --> 04:34.287
But he is a good guy.

76
04:35.557 --> 04:36.557
Get some rest.

77
05:07.747 --> 05:08.917
What is it, Mom?

78
05:10.617 --> 05:13.557
Uncle Gyu Oh must be looking at the sky.

79
05:15.127 --> 05:17.027
He must be looking at the sky, Uncle Gyu Oh.

80
05:17.227 --> 05:18.997
I look at the sky too, Mom.

81
05:19.427 --> 05:22.667
I saw it at school, and I saw it this morning too.

82
05:23.097 --> 05:25.937
- I look at it every single day. - Right,

83
05:26.567 --> 05:29.677
the sky that our Gyeol looks at every single day,

84
05:30.307 --> 05:32.207
I thought Uncle Gyu Oh was not looking at it,

85
05:32.277 --> 05:33.947
so I was a little worried.

86
05:34.507 --> 05:36.877
But look at this.

87
05:37.277 --> 05:38.547
Uncle Gyu Oh took a picture of the sky...

88
05:38.647 --> 05:40.017
and sent it.

89
05:41.147 --> 05:44.087
- I am just so, so happy. - I can...

90
05:44.157 --> 05:47.057
I can take a picture of the sky too and send it.

91
05:47.057 --> 05:48.057
That is right.

92
05:48.187 --> 05:51.597
Our Gyeol can do anything. You are a multitasker.

93
05:51.667 --> 05:54.627
No, you are perfectly well-rounded, my son.

94
05:54.827 --> 05:55.837
Come here.

95
05:58.097 --> 05:59.137
But Mom...

96
05:59.537 --> 06:02.177
- Yes? - Uncle Gyu Oh is like a frog...

97
06:02.237 --> 06:03.937
hibernating in the winter, right?

98
06:04.507 --> 06:08.847
He is asleep when I go to school, and he is asleep when I come back.

99
06:09.577 --> 06:11.417
He just sleeps all the time, right?

100
06:11.717 --> 06:12.917
No, Gyeol.

101
06:13.647 --> 06:17.157
Uncle Gyu Oh must have woken up from his sleep.

102
06:17.817 --> 06:19.987
Uncle Gyu Oh is done sleeping now...

103
06:22.397 --> 06:23.497
and must have woken up.

104
06:28.337 --> 06:30.237
I wake up too, Mom.

105
06:30.737 --> 06:32.967
I woke up this morning too.

106
06:42.617 --> 06:45.887
I will be wearing pink. I will be easy to spot.

107
06:56.457 --> 06:57.627
Is that my brother?

108
06:59.467 --> 07:00.997
It is Han Gyu Oh, right? That napkin.

109
07:07.267 --> 07:08.477
What did you just say?

110
07:09.677 --> 07:12.347
Give up on him, Ms. Kwon. Give up on him.

111
07:13.277 --> 07:15.077
I thought you told me not to give up.

112
07:15.647 --> 07:17.877
You told me not to give up and to teach him a lesson.

113
07:18.687 --> 07:20.547
That was because he is my brother.

114
07:21.687 --> 07:23.657
I do not really care about other people's lives,

115
07:23.717 --> 07:25.127
because my family is the most important.

116
07:26.557 --> 07:27.827
But he just sleeps all the time.

117
07:28.457 --> 07:32.027
Anyway, he has no will to change, and you are too good for him.

118
07:33.567 --> 07:34.767
I was not thinking straight.

119
07:36.097 --> 07:37.337
Is he not your brother now?

120
07:38.167 --> 07:40.937
Did Gyu Oh's dad kick him out of the family?

121
07:41.667 --> 07:43.907
He will be my brother until the day I die,

122
07:44.577 --> 07:45.777
but cutting ties with someone like him...

123
07:45.847 --> 07:47.247
as soon as possible...

124
07:47.477 --> 07:49.447
is the shortcut to living a long life.

125
07:49.617 --> 07:50.877
What are you talking about?

126
07:51.547 --> 07:54.117
He ignores your calls and ignores your messages,

127
07:54.187 --> 07:56.557
gets on your nerves, angers you, and makes you anxious.

128
07:56.987 --> 07:58.287
You are getting an insane amount of stress...

129
07:58.357 --> 07:59.357
because of him.

130
08:00.227 --> 08:02.797
He keeps you up at night, ruins your appetite,

131
08:02.927 --> 08:04.627
and makes you tear up napkins like this.

132
08:05.197 --> 08:06.197
He's a total heartbreaker,

133
08:06.267 --> 08:07.697
so why are you seeing someone like him?

134
08:08.997 --> 08:12.637
Who said I want a longer life? Who asked you for a shortcut?

135
08:14.267 --> 08:16.437
I'm thirsty. Can I drink this?

136
08:30.387 --> 08:31.487
Are you by any chance...

137
08:32.487 --> 08:33.657
jealous of your brother?

138
08:34.387 --> 08:35.857
Are you jealous that he might work out...

139
08:36.157 --> 08:38.227
with a pretty and great woman like me?

140
08:38.427 --> 08:40.567
I could die for my brother.

141
08:41.067 --> 08:44.367
If my brother fell in the water and I could die trying to save him,

142
08:44.737 --> 08:45.967
would I still jump in?

143
08:47.337 --> 08:49.977
Yes. I'd just jump in.

144
09:02.087 --> 09:03.817
You're doing this because you don't trust me.

145
09:05.287 --> 09:06.987
You're worried I'll hurt your brother.

146
09:07.757 --> 09:09.157
That I'll break his heart.

147
09:10.097 --> 09:11.357
That's why you're doing this, right?

148
09:12.027 --> 09:14.067
You're afraid I might actually give up on him.

149
09:15.267 --> 09:17.267
So you're beating me to the punch?

150
09:18.367 --> 09:19.367
No, I'm not.

151
09:20.307 --> 09:21.307
I'm not.

152
09:22.107 --> 09:24.537
- I'm really not. - Don't lie.

153
09:24.937 --> 09:26.407
You're not even good at it.

154
09:30.577 --> 09:31.917
I just found another reason...

155
09:31.917 --> 09:33.547
why I shouldn't give up on Han Gyu Oh.

156
09:34.087 --> 09:36.787
Why would I give up on Han Gyu Oh...

157
09:36.857 --> 09:38.487
when he has such a cute and touching younger brother?

158
09:40.527 --> 09:43.697
I really want to marry Han Gyu Oh and become a part of your family.

159
09:45.267 --> 09:46.797
I absolutely have to.

160
09:55.037 --> 09:57.237
The night sky is so pretty, right, Gyu Oh?

161
09:57.677 --> 09:59.877
They say if you go somewhere with clean air or an observatory,

162
09:59.947 --> 10:01.507
you can see the stars.

163
10:01.577 --> 10:03.817
Let's definitely go see them together later.

164
10:05.417 --> 10:09.157
(Boss)

165
10:10.017 --> 10:11.157
Yes, ma'am.

166
10:11.487 --> 10:13.357
I'm on my way back from the delivery.

167
10:13.957 --> 10:15.757
I'm almost there. I'm nearby.

168
10:16.497 --> 10:17.497
Okay.

169
10:30.037 --> 10:34.277
Gyeol's mom is almost here, so please wait a little bit.

170
10:35.317 --> 10:36.417
Now...

171
10:37.317 --> 10:41.187
From now on, Gyeol's Mom will be in charge of this place.

172
10:42.017 --> 10:43.257
Ma'am, are you going somewhere?

173
10:44.157 --> 10:46.987
It's not like I'm going far away or anything.

174
10:48.597 --> 10:51.727
But ever since you walked in earlier,

175
10:51.797 --> 10:54.227
you've looked really familiar.

176
10:55.027 --> 10:58.237
- I do? - Yes. Hold on a second.

177
10:58.537 --> 11:00.567
Why do you look so familiar?

178
11:01.207 --> 11:03.207
I've definitely seen you somewhere before.

179
11:03.277 --> 11:06.107
Where could it have been?

180
11:14.787 --> 11:16.557
Seriously, what's wrong with me lately?

181
11:16.957 --> 11:20.087
I guess I really do have a common-looking face.

182
11:20.157 --> 11:21.887
Even when I was coming here earlier, someone...

183
11:21.957 --> 11:25.367
- Do you know me by any chance? - If this face is common,

184
11:25.767 --> 11:28.227
then pigs can fly.

185
11:28.797 --> 11:31.297
Look me straight in the eye. Okay?

186
11:31.567 --> 11:34.537
I will figure it out somehow.

187
11:38.207 --> 11:39.877
I know.

188
11:40.447 --> 11:41.907
I know who you are...

189
11:46.447 --> 11:47.687
Just kidding.

190
11:49.217 --> 11:50.787
Where would I have seen...

191
11:50.857 --> 11:52.327
a famous restaurant chef?

192
11:55.527 --> 11:58.797
My taste buds are gone, and my eyes are going bad.

193
11:59.627 --> 12:01.527
I am completely useless now.

194
12:01.667 --> 12:05.197
I have become a useless piece of junk.

195
12:05.837 --> 12:07.437
I am back.

196
12:08.507 --> 12:13.447
Yes, yes. Say hello. He is a famous restaurant chef.

197
12:13.947 --> 12:16.077
He wants our Radish Water Kimchi...

198
12:16.147 --> 12:18.717
and White Kimchi from now on,

199
12:18.847 --> 12:21.847
and he will pay whatever we ask.

200
12:21.917 --> 12:23.457
From now on, I will pick up...

201
12:23.517 --> 12:24.517
the kimchi myself every day.

202
12:24.587 --> 12:27.957
You will come yourself, Chef?

203
12:28.027 --> 12:30.557
You mean you will taste it...

204
12:30.627 --> 12:33.027
every day before buying it.

205
12:33.527 --> 12:36.237
You are very thorough.

206
12:39.367 --> 12:42.377
Ma'am, we do not have enough Radish Water or White Kimchi...

207
12:42.377 --> 12:43.707
even to sell in the store.

208
12:43.777 --> 12:45.477
We do not have the capacity to supply them.

209
12:45.807 --> 12:48.347
I already signed the contract.

210
12:48.407 --> 12:50.277
The ink is already dry,

211
12:50.347 --> 12:51.747
so we have to make it work.

212
12:52.987 --> 12:54.817
Then I will see you again tomorrow morning.

213
12:54.887 --> 12:57.687
Yes. Earlier,

214
12:57.757 --> 12:59.587
I said you looked familiar...

215
12:59.657 --> 13:01.487
for no reason. I am sorry.

216
13:01.557 --> 13:03.727
- No, it is fine. - Take care.

217
13:08.127 --> 13:10.467
I get to see that handsome face every day.

218
13:14.467 --> 13:15.737
If only I had a daughter,

219
13:15.807 --> 13:17.707
I would want him as my son-in-law.

220
13:17.937 --> 13:19.907
He is handsome, capable,

221
13:19.977 --> 13:22.117
smart, and thorough.

222
13:22.817 --> 13:23.877
Since he is a chef,

223
13:23.947 --> 13:26.047
he must cook well, too.

224
13:28.387 --> 13:30.087
If you dump our Heung Sik,

225
13:30.157 --> 13:32.227
it should be for a man like him.

226
13:32.357 --> 13:33.987
If you dump our Heung Sik...

227
13:34.057 --> 13:36.097
and go to a man like him,

228
13:36.397 --> 13:40.727
then I am okay with it. I would approve of it, too.

229
13:42.737 --> 13:44.697
It is a shame to give him to someone else.

230
13:44.997 --> 13:48.307
Since things did not work out with our Heung Sik anyway...

231
13:49.407 --> 13:51.277
Should I call you my daughter...

232
13:51.337 --> 13:53.547
and set you up with him?

233
13:53.907 --> 13:55.047
Ma'am.

234
13:56.217 --> 13:58.177
I know, I know. That is going too far.

235
13:58.847 --> 14:01.787
I should have had one more daughter.

236
14:02.217 --> 14:04.417
Why was Heung Sik's father...

237
14:04.487 --> 14:05.887
in such a hurry...

238
14:05.957 --> 14:09.397
that he had to pass away first? Seriously.

239
14:46.397 --> 14:47.627
(AI Voice: Speak. It Will Reply Automatically After Recognition.)

240
14:47.697 --> 14:49.867
There is someone I like,

241
14:50.767 --> 14:52.067
but he and I...

242
14:52.737 --> 14:54.467
can never be together.

243
14:56.737 --> 14:58.677
But he will not give up.

244
15:00.607 --> 15:02.317
No matter how I push him away,

245
15:03.317 --> 15:04.647
he will not even listen.

246
15:05.617 --> 15:09.657
Can you tell me how to disappoint him and make him...

247
15:10.757 --> 15:14.587
fed up with me, so he runs away from me?

248
15:15.727 --> 15:17.057
The hardest part is not...

249
15:17.257 --> 15:19.397
cutting them off firmly...

250
15:19.597 --> 15:20.967
but maintaining an attitude...

251
15:21.027 --> 15:22.497
that leaves no hope.

252
15:22.997 --> 15:26.237
People cling to possibilities rather than words.

253
15:26.937 --> 15:28.667
But you need to think carefully about whether...

254
15:28.737 --> 15:29.977
your reason for ending this relationship...

255
15:30.177 --> 15:32.077
is out of consideration for the other person...

256
15:32.307 --> 15:35.077
or because you're afraid of a future...

257
15:35.147 --> 15:38.177
where you might disappoint them.

258
15:38.777 --> 15:41.787
If it's the latter, how to make them...

259
16:03.437 --> 16:04.937
It's not a dream, Mu Jin.

260
16:05.477 --> 16:06.847
It's really me, Gyu Rim.

261
16:09.047 --> 16:10.377
I thought if I came around this time,

262
16:10.477 --> 16:11.977
I'd be able to see you.

263
16:13.887 --> 16:15.817
If you came here suddenly at this hour,

264
16:17.087 --> 16:18.517
it doesn't seem like good news.

265
16:20.927 --> 16:24.457
Until 30 minutes before I woke up, I was having a really happy dream.

266
16:25.027 --> 16:27.367
A dream where you and I went back nine years.

267
16:27.927 --> 16:29.767
Like we were the only two in the world,

268
16:30.367 --> 16:32.037
like we would never break up,

269
16:32.267 --> 16:34.737
a dream where we loved each other fiercely.

270
16:35.307 --> 16:37.337
So if you're going to say harsh things...

271
16:37.407 --> 16:40.347
like telling me to get lost, do it next time...

272
16:40.947 --> 16:44.177
Do it next time. I really want to be happy today.

273
16:44.517 --> 16:47.387
- I even had such a killer dream. - Okay.

274
16:48.687 --> 16:50.057
I'll do as you say.

275
16:52.057 --> 16:55.227
Let's go all the way and see what happens to us.

276
16:57.757 --> 16:59.697
Let's get back together.

277
17:03.267 --> 17:04.597
Just like nine years ago.

278
17:05.767 --> 17:07.937
Like we never broke up.

279
17:26.057 --> 17:28.587
Why? Did they say there's a problem with the report?

280
17:28.927 --> 17:31.957
The report is perfect. I'm Han Gyu Young.

281
17:32.097 --> 17:33.667
Of course. Then what's with that pose...

282
17:33.727 --> 17:34.927
right before you tear your hair out?

283
17:40.807 --> 17:41.907
I think I might be...

284
17:43.037 --> 17:44.937
a victim of marriage fraud, Se Hee.

285
17:48.007 --> 17:50.877
Aren't you the one who committed it, rather than the victim?

286
17:54.447 --> 17:58.457
You're the one who committed fraud. Calling Chairman Jang your father.

287
17:59.557 --> 18:01.887
Why didn't I cut you off sooner?

288
18:04.097 --> 18:07.567
Because if you cut me off, you won't have any friends left.

289
18:22.377 --> 18:24.517
Why? What is it now?

290
18:29.717 --> 18:31.487
(My Love)

291
18:35.457 --> 18:36.457
Where are you?

292
18:38.097 --> 18:39.197
I'll see you at home in one hour.

293
18:40.927 --> 18:43.437
I'm taking a half-day off, so you take one too.

294
18:45.907 --> 18:49.877
It turns out Jo Heung Sik is actually our distant cousin.

295
18:50.107 --> 18:54.177
I just received a photo. Should I take it to Jo Heung Sik then?

296
18:54.577 --> 18:55.777
I said take a half-day off.

297
19:00.647 --> 19:02.857
I should send this to Jung Mi.

298
19:07.927 --> 19:08.927
What are you doing?

299
19:11.727 --> 19:13.427
Distant cousin, my foot.

300
19:13.697 --> 19:15.167
What's your relationship with Jo Heung Sik?

301
19:15.527 --> 19:17.437
You two are having an affair, aren't you?

302
19:17.737 --> 19:18.737
What?

303
19:18.897 --> 19:21.467
What nonsense about an affair. Do you think I'm you?

304
19:22.977 --> 19:25.137
Hey, you little...

305
19:25.737 --> 19:28.007
Go ahead and hit me. If I tell Jo Heung Sik,

306
19:28.077 --> 19:29.147
you will need a full set of dentures...

307
19:29.277 --> 19:30.517
for your upper and lower jaws.

308
19:41.027 --> 19:44.227
This was taken a long time ago. Way before I married you.

309
19:45.867 --> 19:48.167
Do you think I got my doctorate by playing cards?

310
19:48.497 --> 19:49.497
What?

311
19:50.197 --> 19:51.667
Do you think I am an idiot?

312
19:51.737 --> 19:53.167
I bought you those clothes one week ago.

313
19:53.237 --> 19:54.607
The clothes you are wearing in the picture.

314
19:54.667 --> 19:56.307
You idiot.

315
19:56.577 --> 19:58.607
You are disgusting. Disgusting.

316
19:59.507 --> 20:02.477
- What are you doing? - Mom!

317
20:04.617 --> 20:07.847
What kind of behaviour is this for a newlywed?

318
20:08.417 --> 20:10.257
You should be in your honeymoon phase,

319
20:10.417 --> 20:11.887
so why are you hitting him?

320
20:13.387 --> 20:15.287
Sung Wook is still seeing that woman.

321
20:15.357 --> 20:17.027
He is enjoying his honeymoon phase with her.

322
20:17.197 --> 20:18.197
What?

323
20:18.427 --> 20:21.097
Hey, have you still not broken up with that girl?

324
20:21.197 --> 20:22.937
Well, what can I do when she will not leave me alone?

325
20:23.297 --> 20:24.637
She'll kill herself if I break up with her,

326
20:24.697 --> 20:26.107
so what am I supposed to do?

327
20:27.137 --> 20:28.567
It is driving me crazy too. It is hard for me too.

328
20:28.637 --> 20:30.137
They say the apple does not fall far from the tree.

329
20:30.537 --> 20:32.907
Of all things, why did you have to inherit that awful trait?

330
20:33.007 --> 20:36.077
Of all things to learn, you learned such a terrible thing.

331
20:36.177 --> 20:38.147
How could your father teach his only son...

332
20:38.347 --> 20:41.017
to be like this?

333
20:42.447 --> 20:45.487
You should focus on your own life. Stop seeing those host bar guys.

334
20:45.757 --> 20:47.457
Hey, you punk.

335
20:48.157 --> 20:51.297
- Hey, what are you talking about? - Stop playing dumb.

336
20:51.697 --> 20:52.727
Everyone in Gangnam knows...

337
20:52.867 --> 20:55.767
- that you go to host bars. - Hey.

338
20:55.827 --> 20:58.167
Do you really like guys young enough to be your son?

339
20:58.867 --> 21:03.307
- You little punk. Hey. - What?

340
21:03.377 --> 21:05.037
Will you be quiet? Gosh.

341
21:39.507 --> 21:41.277
Should I work part-time here with you?

342
21:45.617 --> 21:46.617
Crazy jerk.

343
21:46.917 --> 21:48.417
Are we on good enough terms to work together?

344
21:48.917 --> 21:50.587
Are we on such bad terms that we cannot even work together?

345
21:51.987 --> 21:53.957
I told you Seo Min Ju and I are nothing,

346
21:54.557 --> 21:55.557
and we never will be.

347
21:56.357 --> 21:57.727
As for upsetting you,

348
21:58.827 --> 22:00.167
did the settlement money from my beating...

349
22:00.227 --> 22:01.227
not settle that?

350
22:02.367 --> 22:04.037
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

351
22:04.567 --> 22:05.867
Here is your food.

352
22:06.767 --> 22:07.867
- Enjoy your meal. - Thank you.

353
22:30.757 --> 22:33.627
(Chairman Jang Hoon Tae)

354
22:41.167 --> 22:43.037
(My Wife)

355
22:43.807 --> 22:45.037
How are you doing?

356
22:52.217 --> 22:53.387
Are you feeling okay?

357
22:54.687 --> 22:56.357
Are you eating well?

358
23:03.357 --> 23:04.357
Yes.

359
23:06.527 --> 23:08.297
I am doing well.

360
23:10.097 --> 23:11.167
How about you?

361
23:12.937 --> 23:14.937
Is the housekeeper making sure you eat well?

362
23:17.137 --> 23:18.437
She knows your preferences and tastes...

363
23:18.577 --> 23:21.647
very well, so I am not worried.

364
23:22.507 --> 23:24.847
No. I am eating well. Of course. Yes.

365
23:25.717 --> 23:27.487
I am doing well, so do not worry.

366
23:29.247 --> 23:31.087
Thank you. I am glad you are doing well.

367
23:31.887 --> 23:32.887
Yes.

368
23:36.127 --> 23:41.067
Can I ask where you are and how you are doing?

369
23:44.597 --> 23:48.537
I started working part-time at a barbecue restaurant.

370
23:49.037 --> 23:50.537
My place is near here, too.

371
23:53.047 --> 23:54.507
A barbecue restaurant?

372
23:56.077 --> 23:59.017
Working at a barbecue restaurant is hard even for young people.

373
24:01.117 --> 24:03.057
If it is not hard, it is not work.

374
24:04.617 --> 24:05.687
It is fun.

375
24:06.857 --> 24:07.957
Since I am using my body a lot,

376
24:08.687 --> 24:11.097
I sleep well at night, and the food tastes good.

377
24:12.027 --> 24:13.367
Is that so? That is a relief.

378
24:14.167 --> 24:18.067
Is the food there good? Can I go there to eat sometime?

379
24:22.407 --> 24:24.237
Yes. It is good.

380
24:24.777 --> 24:25.907
You should come by sometime.

381
24:26.477 --> 24:27.477
Excuse me.

382
24:28.277 --> 24:29.517
Yes, just a moment.

383
24:30.547 --> 24:32.047
I will call you back later.

384
24:34.517 --> 24:35.717
Yes, I am coming.

385
24:43.957 --> 24:46.597
You are not really thinking about breaking up with me, right?

386
24:50.837 --> 24:52.267
You are not, right?

387
25:11.087 --> 25:13.357
(Kim Gyu Seo)

388
25:14.957 --> 25:17.657
- Hello. - Yes, hello. This is Kim Gyu Seo.

389
25:18.097 --> 25:20.127
From the other day near the Geumje-dong shopping center.

390
25:21.027 --> 25:22.327
Yes, I remember.

391
25:22.867 --> 25:23.997
How have you been?

392
25:24.537 --> 25:25.537
Good.

393
25:25.967 --> 25:27.937
You mentioned you would buy me a meal...

394
25:28.467 --> 25:30.007
and told me to contact you anytime.

395
25:31.007 --> 25:32.807
I have a lot of free time this evening.

396
25:35.977 --> 25:38.217
Then I will see you this evening.

397
25:39.017 --> 25:41.017
I will send you the location.

398
25:42.117 --> 25:43.187
Yes, thank you.

399
25:45.317 --> 25:47.027
Why are you meeting Gyu Rim's mother?

400
25:47.627 --> 25:49.497
Why are you meeting her using a fake name?

401
25:49.727 --> 25:50.727
I was curious.

402
25:51.557 --> 25:52.557
Curious about what?

403
25:52.627 --> 25:55.067
If she met a man a hundred times better than our father...

404
25:55.197 --> 25:58.967
- and is living a happy life. - Where would you find...

405
25:59.097 --> 26:00.107
a man worse than our dad?

406
26:00.267 --> 26:03.177
And if she is not living happily, what are you going to do about it?

407
26:03.307 --> 26:04.707
Are you going to set her up on a blind date?

408
26:04.837 --> 26:06.037
Are you obsessed with taking responsibility?

409
26:06.407 --> 26:09.147
You try to take responsibility for everything in the world.

410
26:11.077 --> 26:12.117
Did you give up on your diet?

411
26:14.117 --> 26:16.657
Why would I give up? It is because of you.

412
26:16.787 --> 26:20.657
The kids keep trying to impress you, so they keep buying me bread.

413
26:20.827 --> 26:22.557
If I gain weight, it is your fault, Han Gyu Seo.

414
26:37.237 --> 26:38.437
Why are you here?

415
26:38.937 --> 26:40.147
Should you not be at work?

416
26:40.777 --> 26:44.377
I went to work yesterday morning and worked until just now.

417
26:45.117 --> 26:46.587
Without getting a wink of sleep.

418
26:46.847 --> 26:48.517
You should go home to sleep.

419
26:48.517 --> 26:52.017
This is the restaurant's rooftop. What are you going to do...

420
26:52.517 --> 26:54.287
if you run into Mu Jin?

421
26:56.127 --> 26:57.597
If I run into him, I run into him.

422
26:58.197 --> 26:59.297
Did I commit a crime?

423
26:59.797 --> 27:02.127
Are we Prince Suyang and Kim Jong Seo?

424
27:04.237 --> 27:05.237
You are right.

425
27:05.497 --> 27:08.237
It is not like you two are mortal enemies.

426
27:10.277 --> 27:11.977
It is not like you will never see each other again.

427
27:13.907 --> 27:16.447
Our Seo Hyun.

428
27:18.477 --> 27:20.317
Since when did you become so mature?

429
27:22.787 --> 27:25.757
Do you still see me as a middle schooler?

430
27:26.257 --> 27:27.727
Of course I do, kiddo.

431
27:29.657 --> 27:30.957
I am hungry.

432
27:31.027 --> 27:32.627
I want my mom's soybean paste stew...

433
27:34.197 --> 27:36.267
I want some black bean noodles.

434
27:45.237 --> 27:47.807
You are the only one I can ask about this.

435
27:48.377 --> 27:49.677
Okay, ask away.

436
27:52.177 --> 27:54.487
If my mom and dad get a divorce,

437
27:56.047 --> 27:57.057
is it because of me?

438
28:03.227 --> 28:05.257
Are they getting a divorce?

439
28:06.467 --> 28:08.967
If they do. If they end up getting a divorce,

440
28:09.027 --> 28:13.167
is it my fault? Am I 100 percent the reason?

441
28:18.407 --> 28:19.507
Why are you not answering?

442
28:20.007 --> 28:23.247
I am asking you a question. Is it my fault that Mom left home...

443
28:23.317 --> 28:26.547
and my fault if they get a divorce? Is everything all my fault?

444
28:29.547 --> 28:30.917
You usually never stop talking for even one minute,

445
28:30.987 --> 28:34.087
so why are you not answering? Say something, Park Jung Woo.

446
29:12.897 --> 29:15.567
Did I say banana milk?

447
29:17.597 --> 29:18.667
I said strawberry milk...

448
29:19.467 --> 29:20.467
You did?

449
29:21.237 --> 29:23.777
I must have heard you wrong. I will go buy it right now.

450
29:34.817 --> 29:38.587
Did I say strawberry milk? Did I not say chocolate milk?

451
29:44.897 --> 29:46.257
So you want chocolate milk.

452
29:47.597 --> 29:48.627
I will be right back with it.

453
30:06.447 --> 30:07.787
Chocolate is the best flavour anyway.

454
30:10.187 --> 30:11.917
Should I just have plain milk?

455
30:13.357 --> 30:14.727
Maybe because it is so early,

456
30:14.787 --> 30:16.127
I am not craving anything sweet.

457
30:20.827 --> 30:21.827
Right?

458
30:21.897 --> 30:23.467
You should not drink it if you do not want it.

459
30:23.937 --> 30:26.367
You want plain milk, right? I will go get plain milk right now.

460
30:39.847 --> 30:41.417
Here, take your pick.

461
30:41.587 --> 30:43.287
I bought everything from the convenience store,

462
30:43.357 --> 30:45.157
so choose whatever you want to drink.

463
30:48.957 --> 30:50.327
Are you messing with me right now?

464
30:50.897 --> 30:51.897
What?

465
30:51.957 --> 30:52.997
Do you want me to drink all this...

466
30:53.057 --> 30:54.227
and drink myself to death?

467
30:54.427 --> 30:55.627
Are you showing off how much money you have?

468
30:55.697 --> 30:57.337
Do I look like a thirsty rhinoceros to you?

469
30:57.837 --> 30:59.067
No, that is not it.

470
31:00.507 --> 31:03.677
I just brought everything so you could pick out...

471
31:03.937 --> 31:05.107
whatever you wanted to drink...

472
31:07.507 --> 31:09.547
How can you make someone feel so miserable?

473
31:09.947 --> 31:12.277
Is having a lot of money everything? Does having money mean you can...

474
31:12.347 --> 31:13.987
trample all over someone's pride like that?

475
31:15.087 --> 31:16.087
No...

476
31:20.527 --> 31:21.957
I am sorry, Gyu Rim.

477
31:23.227 --> 31:24.257
I was wrong.

478
31:24.327 --> 31:27.297
- I was being thoughtless. - I am so upset right now...

479
31:27.367 --> 31:28.967
that I do not even want to say a single word.

480
31:29.127 --> 31:31.367
- Gyu Rim... - I am leaving.

481
31:46.117 --> 31:47.347
What was that?

482
31:48.217 --> 31:49.347
Why is she acting like that?

483
31:51.657 --> 31:53.117
Why is she doing things she never...

484
31:55.587 --> 31:56.627
No...

485
31:56.797 --> 31:58.057
I was in the wrong.

486
32:00.127 --> 32:01.767
She had every right to be angry.

487
32:03.597 --> 32:05.337
You are so awful, Han Gyu Rim.

488
32:10.577 --> 32:11.907
What do I do?

489
32:13.307 --> 32:15.477
No. You did good.

490
32:15.547 --> 32:16.617
That is how he will get sick of you.

491
32:16.677 --> 32:18.547
That is how he will lose all feelings and run away.

492
32:18.917 --> 32:20.287
It is okay. You did good.

493
32:26.627 --> 32:27.627
Excuse me.

494
32:28.657 --> 32:31.497
The boss wants you to come over for a minute.

495
32:34.197 --> 32:35.197
What?

496
32:40.337 --> 32:41.637
(Special Notice: Closed One Week For Interior Renovations)

497
32:41.707 --> 32:42.967
(Up To 50 Percent Off All Items. Special Sale)

498
32:43.037 --> 32:45.137
When did you decorate like this?

499
32:48.707 --> 32:50.617
You're so pretty, ma'am.

500
32:52.717 --> 32:57.417
From this moment on, my job has changed a little.

501
32:57.487 --> 33:00.827
From now on, I am the boss here.

502
33:00.987 --> 33:04.957
And from now on, you are the boss of Suragan Side Dishes.

503
33:06.227 --> 33:09.897
- What do you mean? - The side dish store...

504
33:09.967 --> 33:11.567
closing for one week from tomorrow...

505
33:11.637 --> 33:13.837
is not because of interior renovations...

506
33:14.137 --> 33:17.077
but to prepare you to be the boss.

507
33:17.237 --> 33:19.907
- So keep that in mind. - That makes no sense.

508
33:19.977 --> 33:22.507
How can I be the boss? That makes no sense, ma'am.

509
33:22.577 --> 33:25.177
Then should I hand it over to a complete stranger?

510
33:27.887 --> 33:29.187
Or should I hand it over to Heung Sik,

511
33:29.247 --> 33:31.487
who cannot even boil one pack of ramyeon?

512
33:31.687 --> 33:34.427
Do you know how hard I worked to protect that place?

513
33:34.727 --> 33:37.757
The location is good, and there are many regulars.

514
33:37.857 --> 33:40.867
It is the best of the best.

515
33:42.767 --> 33:47.207
Well, if you really cannot do it, I will just have to close it down.

516
33:47.937 --> 33:48.937
Thank you.

517
33:50.377 --> 33:52.707
You can just keep running it.

518
33:53.007 --> 33:55.247
You did not say anything until earlier,

519
33:55.307 --> 33:58.017
so why are you suddenly running a medical equipment store?

520
33:58.077 --> 34:00.717
You know my nephew who used to be the boss here?

521
34:01.317 --> 34:03.357
He has to go to the US,

522
34:03.417 --> 34:06.727
and he said he could not hand over such a good place to a stranger.

523
34:07.127 --> 34:10.527
"Nephew. I agree with you."

524
34:10.827 --> 34:13.967
He and I just high-fived.

525
34:14.697 --> 34:17.097
No, no, that is not what is important.

526
34:18.837 --> 34:19.967
Are you going to do it or not?

527
34:20.607 --> 34:24.007
Are you going to take over such a great place or not?

528
34:26.177 --> 34:30.517
But I still cannot do it, ma'am. How dare I become the boss?

529
34:30.617 --> 34:31.677
That makes no sense.

530
34:32.347 --> 34:34.847
Do you think I was born as a boss?

531
34:35.317 --> 34:37.087
Seriously...

532
34:37.317 --> 34:38.957
I cannot even pretend to be elegant, gosh...

533
34:42.727 --> 34:44.297
For some time now,

534
34:44.557 --> 34:47.627
my tongue has stopped working, so I cannot taste food.

535
34:48.667 --> 34:52.037
I cannot taste sourness, and I cannot taste sweetness.

536
34:56.707 --> 34:59.177
You had a slight feeling about it too, right?

537
35:00.107 --> 35:02.077
It is broken like this,

538
35:02.807 --> 35:05.717
so how can I be the boss of a side dish store?

539
35:07.817 --> 35:11.217
- Ma'am... - You really have a talent.

540
35:11.287 --> 35:12.687
If I say I am giving it to you,

541
35:12.757 --> 35:14.487
you should just accept it with gratitude.

542
35:14.957 --> 35:19.097
You just had to make me confess my weakness like this.

543
35:19.997 --> 35:22.497
Are we in such an uncomfortable relationship...

544
35:22.597 --> 35:24.437
that we have to twist things again?

545
35:25.567 --> 35:28.337
If a person is too humble...

546
35:28.407 --> 35:30.637
or too nice, it is exhausting.

547
35:31.077 --> 35:32.807
We are starting your special owner training tomorrow,

548
35:32.877 --> 35:34.777
so you better be ready, okay?

549
35:36.847 --> 35:38.247
My goodness.

550
35:38.947 --> 35:40.017
Here...

551
35:40.087 --> 35:41.747
How many square feet is this land?

552
35:43.587 --> 35:45.217
Mr. Han.

553
35:46.257 --> 35:48.627
Hey. What time is it right now?

554
35:48.687 --> 35:50.527
When an elder calls, you should come running immediately.

555
35:50.597 --> 35:52.197
You have completely lost your discipline.

556
35:52.427 --> 35:54.367
I am only two minutes late.

557
35:54.427 --> 35:56.127
Right? As soon as I received your call,

558
35:56.197 --> 35:58.097
I ran over here as fast as I could.

559
35:59.867 --> 36:01.567
Why do we not just grill some pork belly?

560
36:01.637 --> 36:03.067
Why are we eating Italian food? It does not suit us.

561
36:03.137 --> 36:04.877
- Come on, let us go. - Hey, listen.

562
36:05.477 --> 36:08.247
This is the place owned by the guy who likes our Gyu Rim...

563
36:08.307 --> 36:10.747
I mean, they dated before and broke up,

564
36:10.817 --> 36:13.117
but he said he wants to try to make things work again.

565
36:13.687 --> 36:16.587
So I am here to do a little background check myself.

566
36:16.647 --> 36:18.617
I need to see if he is someone I can approve of...

567
36:18.687 --> 36:20.757
or if I should completely tear them apart.

568
36:20.827 --> 36:22.727
You do not need to do a background check.

569
36:22.787 --> 36:23.997
The owner here is a good guy.

570
36:24.057 --> 36:25.697
- Now, let us go. - Hey,

571
36:26.357 --> 36:27.497
how would you know?

572
36:28.667 --> 36:32.097
I talked to him a few times, and I could just tell.

573
36:32.167 --> 36:33.507
Let us go to the place right across the street...

574
36:33.567 --> 36:35.607
and have some pork belly and soju.

575
36:35.667 --> 36:38.337
If Gyu Rim finds out we came here, she will throw a fit.

576
36:39.877 --> 36:40.877
Hey.

577
36:40.947 --> 36:43.647
Do you know the heart of a father with a daughter?

578
36:43.777 --> 36:44.777
No, I do not know.

579
36:44.847 --> 36:46.677
If you do not know, then just keep your mouth shut.

580
36:50.687 --> 36:53.317
Now, Heung Sik. Let us go.

581
36:55.557 --> 36:57.827
This is exhausting, so exhausting.

582
37:05.837 --> 37:06.837
Welcome.

583
37:14.907 --> 37:15.907
This?

584
37:23.217 --> 37:25.357
It has been a while.

585
37:25.857 --> 37:28.787
I am here as a customer today to eat spaghetti,

586
37:29.057 --> 37:30.227
so you do not need to glare at me.

587
37:33.297 --> 37:34.467
How many are in your party?

588
37:34.767 --> 37:35.767
Two people.

589
37:37.597 --> 37:38.597
Sir!

590
37:44.877 --> 37:46.947
- Who are you? - Excuse me?

591
37:48.607 --> 37:49.607
Yes.

592
37:49.847 --> 37:51.577
I am Park Jung Woo, the manager of Dasolo.

593
37:51.847 --> 37:53.747
Is Kim Mu Jin the owner of this restaurant?

594
37:54.317 --> 37:56.247
He said he was a co-owner.

595
37:57.487 --> 38:00.687
I wonder how much of a stake he has.

596
38:00.987 --> 38:02.327
Excuse me, but who are you?

597
38:04.297 --> 38:05.697
He is Han Gyu Rim's father.

598
38:06.127 --> 38:07.327
Gosh.

599
38:07.767 --> 38:09.697
You seem to know our Gyu Rim.

600
38:10.897 --> 38:13.067
Then you must also know that Kim Mu Jin...

601
38:13.137 --> 38:15.407
follows our Gyu Rim around everywhere, right?

602
38:16.007 --> 38:17.007
Well?

603
38:25.717 --> 38:27.487
Emergency, emergency. Code red.

604
38:27.987 --> 38:29.887
- What is it now? - At our restaurant...

605
38:31.417 --> 38:32.517
Gyu Rim's father is here.

606
38:36.027 --> 38:37.257
What? Who?

607
38:37.797 --> 38:39.127
Gyu Rim's father.

608
38:42.067 --> 38:43.067
Come quickly, hurry.

609
38:47.567 --> 38:48.567
All of a sudden?

610
38:51.377 --> 38:53.537
The real estate prices around here are no joke.

611
38:53.907 --> 38:56.877
Then the deposit and rent must be expensive too, right?

612
38:58.447 --> 39:01.687
If he can afford that expensive deposit and rent,

613
39:02.417 --> 39:04.287
it means he has that much money, right?

614
39:04.657 --> 39:06.987
Why is money so important?

615
39:07.187 --> 39:08.727
As long as he does not let his wife and kids starve,

616
39:08.787 --> 39:10.127
that is all that matters.

617
39:10.187 --> 39:12.727
Hey, who lets their family starve these days?

618
39:17.137 --> 39:19.167
Hey, why is it so expensive here?

619
39:20.737 --> 39:22.837
Hey, if he can sell such expensive food,

620
39:23.037 --> 39:25.837
it means he makes a pretty good income, right?

621
39:26.277 --> 39:29.147
Please look at the person, not the money.

622
39:29.707 --> 39:31.217
As long as he is a good person, that is enough.

623
39:31.277 --> 39:32.977
Why do you keep talking about money?

624
39:33.317 --> 39:37.157
And as for Kim Mu Jin, did I not tell you I vouch for him?

625
39:37.217 --> 39:38.717
Are you Kim Mu Jin's spokesperson?

626
39:40.387 --> 39:43.427
Seriously. You used to like our Gyu Rim.

627
39:43.797 --> 39:46.357
I completely forgot about that.

628
39:47.597 --> 39:49.497
I should not have brought you.

629
39:50.337 --> 39:52.237
You were the only one around who was not busy.

630
39:52.297 --> 39:55.307
Gyu Rim is just a friend now, a friend, okay?

631
39:55.567 --> 39:59.737
I sincerely hope that my friend meets a good man and is happy.

632
40:01.307 --> 40:03.877
I am a man myself, but even when I look around,

633
40:03.947 --> 40:06.647
- there is no one like Kim Mu Jin. - Forget it.

634
40:08.017 --> 40:09.017
I do not listen to the enemy.

635
40:09.147 --> 40:11.787
Hey, since you are recommending him, I am suddenly getting anxious.

636
40:12.057 --> 40:13.657
This is driving me crazy, seriously.

637
40:14.187 --> 40:16.487
I call a good person good, and you still complain...

638
40:19.157 --> 40:20.157
Heung Sik, hey.

639
40:20.667 --> 40:24.467
Hey. Does Kim Mu Jin have any diseases?

640
40:25.367 --> 40:26.367
Is he really a bachelor?

641
40:26.467 --> 40:28.907
Is he two-timing anyone, or seeing another woman?

642
40:29.467 --> 40:31.137
Or does he have a hidden child?

643
40:31.207 --> 40:33.207
- No, I do not. - He doesn't?

644
40:38.477 --> 40:39.547
I have never been married.

645
40:39.617 --> 40:42.147
I have never two-timed anyone, and I do not have a hidden child.

646
40:42.447 --> 40:44.587
And I had a health checkup three months ago,

647
40:44.887 --> 40:46.487
and all the results were normal.

648
40:47.017 --> 40:49.157
See, he says he does not.

649
40:49.787 --> 40:52.357
Why are you so suspicious of people?

650
40:54.367 --> 40:57.397
I heard you want to start things up with Gyu Rim again?

651
40:58.437 --> 40:59.437
Yes.

652
41:00.707 --> 41:03.437
Good for you. You could search the whole world,

653
41:03.507 --> 41:05.077
and you will not find anyone like Gyu Rim.

654
41:06.337 --> 41:07.777
Of course, I know that.

655
41:09.047 --> 41:12.277
Sir, I am so honoured that you came all the way to this humble place.

656
41:12.477 --> 41:14.817
I should have contacted you and invited you beforehand,

657
41:14.887 --> 41:15.887
but I was too late.

658
41:22.787 --> 41:24.297
But why does that guy who looks like a cricket...

659
41:24.357 --> 41:25.727
keep glaring at me?

660
41:34.467 --> 41:35.467
Hey.

661
41:36.367 --> 41:37.377
What?

662
41:37.637 --> 41:38.677
Quit it!

663
41:41.507 --> 41:44.447
That guy is the co-CEO here and my roommate.

664
41:44.717 --> 41:46.417
He has not had a girlfriend in ten years.

665
41:46.477 --> 41:48.547
But since I have a woman I like...

666
41:48.847 --> 41:52.617
and you even came to visit, I think he might be jealous.

667
41:53.157 --> 41:56.927
That is a shame. He looks like a nice guy.

668
41:57.427 --> 41:58.797
If you have not decided on the menu yet,

669
41:58.857 --> 42:00.867
may I serve you whatever I recommend?

670
42:01.197 --> 42:03.897
If there is anything you cannot eat or do not like,

671
42:04.267 --> 42:05.367
please let me know at any time.

672
42:06.337 --> 42:08.467
- I do not have any. - Okay.

673
42:17.847 --> 42:18.847
How much is all this?

674
42:19.747 --> 42:22.347
Hey, what is your mom's credit card limit?

675
42:23.487 --> 42:24.487
What card?

676
42:27.457 --> 42:29.427
This is the most expensive wine in our restaurant.

677
42:30.557 --> 42:31.827
Shall I open it for you?

678
42:32.557 --> 42:34.297
We did not order this.

679
42:35.367 --> 42:38.497
If it is on the house, we will gladly drink it.

680
42:40.737 --> 42:42.437
Our Mu Jin is treating you.

681
42:43.067 --> 42:44.437
All the food here...

682
42:44.777 --> 42:47.077
is being paid for by our CEO, Kim Mu Jin,

683
42:47.407 --> 42:48.847
with his own card.

684
42:49.247 --> 42:50.677
Is that true?

685
42:51.547 --> 42:52.547
Really?

686
42:53.217 --> 42:54.887
But people have pride.

687
42:55.187 --> 42:56.817
If you feel like you are imposing too much...

688
42:58.617 --> 43:02.027
and want to pay for it yourselves, if you insist on paying,

689
43:02.087 --> 43:04.257
I can help you with the bill anytime.

690
43:05.857 --> 43:07.727
Did you say he looks like a nice guy?

691
43:08.397 --> 43:09.467
I take that back.

692
43:12.737 --> 43:14.907
Would you like to taste it?

693
43:15.637 --> 43:17.877
We will pour it ourselves,

694
43:18.537 --> 43:19.537
so you can just go.

695
43:20.077 --> 43:22.547
Yes. You can go now.

696
43:23.777 --> 43:26.017
Even the cricket by my window is annoying enough to look at.

697
43:30.687 --> 43:32.857
What a rude punk.

698
43:33.517 --> 43:36.887
- Minus ten points because of him. - How can you do that?

699
43:36.987 --> 43:40.127
If Gyu Rim said you were her father, that would be minus 100 points.

700
43:42.067 --> 43:45.367
How much is this wine anyway?

701
43:46.537 --> 43:48.407
Château, Château Paris?

702
43:49.267 --> 43:52.677
Wow. It seems Kim Mu Jin...

703
43:52.737 --> 43:54.847
blew his entire paycheck just to treat you, sir.

704
43:55.347 --> 43:59.047
Wow, this kid is so generous and bold.

705
43:59.517 --> 44:00.987
The more I see him, the better he gets.

706
44:02.047 --> 44:03.187
Go ahead and try it.

707
44:09.957 --> 44:10.957
How is it?

708
44:13.927 --> 44:15.397
- Wow, it is so good. - Is it?

709
44:15.467 --> 44:18.037
Hey, hey, it is too precious, so you only drink a little.

710
44:18.767 --> 44:19.967
Why? Let's drink it together.

711
44:20.937 --> 44:22.007
It is a waste.

712
44:24.237 --> 44:25.237
Okay.

713
44:45.657 --> 44:46.827
Top-grade chuck flap.

714
45:00.137 --> 45:02.177
Now you even brought out the caviar.

715
45:04.317 --> 45:05.477
You are even sprinkling gold on it.

716
45:06.077 --> 45:07.077
All of this...

717
45:07.317 --> 45:08.447
You are giving it all away?

718
45:08.517 --> 45:10.187
Give it all, just give away the restaurant.

719
45:24.997 --> 45:26.837
- Dad. - Yes.

720
45:27.197 --> 45:28.207
My youngest daughter.

721
45:28.907 --> 45:30.207
Does Gyu Min work here?

722
45:30.707 --> 45:32.577
- Yes. - I see.

723
45:32.637 --> 45:34.377
Why did you come here in person?

724
45:34.447 --> 45:36.447
I only asked for the name of his restaurant.

725
45:39.177 --> 45:40.847
Why did you order so much?

726
45:41.287 --> 45:42.787
And only the most expensive items on the menu?

727
45:43.117 --> 45:45.717
It is okay, this is all free.

728
45:47.217 --> 45:49.587
- It really is free. - What?

729
45:51.257 --> 45:53.397
- What? - My gosh.

730
45:54.027 --> 45:56.567
Did you throw a fit to get it for free again?

731
45:56.897 --> 45:58.537
What kind of person do you think your father is?

732
45:58.667 --> 46:01.537
Hey, Son-in-law Kim treated me to all of this.

733
46:02.067 --> 46:04.807
- Son-in-law Kim? - Yes, Son-in-law Kim.

734
46:04.877 --> 46:09.277
Or my son-in-law, or Kim Mu Jin. You can just...

735
46:10.147 --> 46:12.617
call him your brother-in-law. It is all settled.

736
46:27.097 --> 46:28.567
Are you really not going in?

737
46:32.267 --> 46:33.467
Let us just go.

738
46:33.737 --> 46:35.837
We came all this way, and we are just leaving?

739
46:39.407 --> 46:41.847
Let us go. Forget it.

740
46:43.747 --> 46:46.917
Mom. It has been eight years already.

741
46:47.347 --> 46:48.347
If you keep this up,

742
46:48.417 --> 46:50.957
you and Mu Jin might really be over for good.

743
46:52.717 --> 46:55.027
Either you get Mu Jin to surrender to you...

744
46:55.357 --> 46:57.757
or you surrender to him.

745
46:58.397 --> 46:59.957
Why would I surrender?

746
47:00.997 --> 47:02.297
I would rather die and become a ghost.

747
47:02.597 --> 47:04.337
I will never accept Han Gyu Rim.

748
47:05.267 --> 47:06.337
Go. Start the car.

749
47:08.237 --> 47:09.237
Mom.

750
47:10.167 --> 47:11.177
Do you want me to drive?

751
47:12.107 --> 47:13.107
Should I call a taxi?

752
47:32.357 --> 47:33.357
My son-in-law.

753
47:34.297 --> 47:36.867
Hey, from today on, you are my son-in-law.

754
47:36.927 --> 47:38.567
- Got it? - Thank you.

755
47:40.597 --> 47:41.607
He is a little drunk.

756
47:41.667 --> 47:44.437
Hey, hey, should I tell Gyu Rim right away?

757
47:44.537 --> 47:46.637
That he is our son-in-law starting today.

758
47:47.007 --> 47:51.247
Can we take it a little slow? You are moving way too fast.

759
47:51.317 --> 47:53.077
I cannot keep up.

760
47:53.177 --> 47:54.787
If you wait here for a moment, I will get the car ready...

761
47:54.847 --> 47:55.987
and drive you home.

762
47:57.017 --> 48:00.317
What planet did you come from?

763
48:00.657 --> 48:02.387
How did you end up...

764
48:02.457 --> 48:05.197
falling right in front of our Gyu Rim?

765
48:05.727 --> 48:06.727
Did you ride a glacier here?

766
48:08.497 --> 48:10.167
I think he is very drunk,

767
48:10.267 --> 48:12.337
so I will take him home. You should go back inside.

768
48:12.637 --> 48:13.637
If you take him home for no reason,

769
48:13.697 --> 48:16.437
- That cricket might kill you. - No, it is fine.

770
48:17.037 --> 48:20.507
If he gets any more excited, he will try to hug and kiss you.

771
48:20.607 --> 48:24.217
- Will you be able to handle that? - I will see you next time, Father.

772
48:24.377 --> 48:28.487
- Okay, my son-in-law. - Let us just go, sir.

773
48:28.717 --> 48:30.517
Chef has to run his business.

774
48:31.617 --> 48:32.617
Let us go.

775
48:32.857 --> 48:35.857
Hey, what is this? Our, our son-in-law,

776
48:36.457 --> 48:38.797
You got this! You should do it too.

777
48:38.857 --> 48:40.257
- You got this! - You got this!

778
48:40.327 --> 48:41.727
- You got this! - You got this!

779
48:42.167 --> 48:43.567
You got this!

780
48:43.897 --> 48:44.897
Let us go.

781
48:45.197 --> 48:48.637
- You got this! - Wipe your drool, gosh.

782
48:52.377 --> 48:55.077
I do not know what is going on here.

783
48:55.977 --> 48:58.017
You told me never to call you again,

784
48:58.977 --> 49:00.177
so what brings you here at this hour?

785
49:01.447 --> 49:03.047
That is why I contacted you.

786
49:06.487 --> 49:08.727
I mean, what kind of life...

787
49:09.327 --> 49:10.957
have I been living?

788
49:11.597 --> 49:13.327
Why are you the only friend...

789
49:13.857 --> 49:15.427
I can call when I am having a hard time?

790
49:17.027 --> 49:18.137
My pride is hurt.

791
49:18.737 --> 49:19.737
It is so annoying.

792
49:21.267 --> 49:22.537
Seriously.

793
49:30.077 --> 49:31.177
Hey, so...

794
49:32.177 --> 49:33.747
when is Yoon Hee coming back?

795
49:36.087 --> 49:39.087
Hey, are you really going to get a divorce or something?

796
49:42.087 --> 49:43.327
I am so forgetful.

797
49:44.297 --> 49:45.927
I forgot to bring the wine glasses again.

798
49:46.357 --> 49:47.597
Forget it. I am leaving.

799
49:48.397 --> 49:50.227
Where are you going? Okay.

800
49:50.297 --> 49:51.467
Then let us just drink from these.

801
49:52.267 --> 49:54.067
You are not even answering my questions...

802
49:54.137 --> 49:55.137
you are half out of your mind,

803
49:55.207 --> 49:57.237
and you are no fun at all. I am leaving.

804
49:58.677 --> 49:59.677
Leaving?

805
50:01.747 --> 50:03.577
Fun?

806
50:04.777 --> 50:08.387
Are you going to meet that fun Sparkling Water Man?

807
50:08.887 --> 50:11.987
- What? Sparkling Water Man? - You know, that weird guy...

808
50:12.057 --> 50:13.117
we saw at the noodle restaurant.

809
50:14.387 --> 50:15.657
What, weird guy? Hey.

810
50:16.957 --> 50:20.297
Are you really seeing him? Get a grip.

811
50:20.797 --> 50:21.797
He is a very strange person.

812
50:21.867 --> 50:23.297
I do not think he is in his right mind.

813
50:23.497 --> 50:24.867
You need someone who suits you.

814
50:25.167 --> 50:27.237
He does not suit you. He is not right for you.

815
50:27.567 --> 50:31.537
Hey, who are you to insult my friend?

816
50:31.607 --> 50:34.007
- Friend? Wow. - Yes.

817
50:34.707 --> 50:35.707
He is my friend.

818
50:36.807 --> 50:38.717
You do not even know what kind of person he is,

819
50:38.847 --> 50:40.317
so how can you talk about him like that?

820
50:40.817 --> 50:42.247
You only saw him once,

821
50:42.317 --> 50:44.017
so why are you judging him however you please?

822
50:44.117 --> 50:45.387
You have fallen hard.

823
50:46.157 --> 50:47.517
You have completely fallen for him.

824
50:49.027 --> 50:52.427
Hey, hey. Are you that great?

825
50:52.727 --> 50:55.597
Right. You are so great...

826
50:55.727 --> 50:57.597
that you fell for a woman like Go Yoon Hee...

827
50:57.667 --> 50:59.537
and even married her?

828
51:01.907 --> 51:03.067
Watch your mouth.

829
51:04.067 --> 51:05.607
Do you not remember the advice...

830
51:05.677 --> 51:06.737
I gave you before you remarried?

831
51:07.137 --> 51:09.307
I told you the exact same thing.

832
51:09.477 --> 51:11.547
I told you to be careful because she seemed weird.

833
51:11.677 --> 51:13.517
I told you she was not right for you.

834
51:13.577 --> 51:14.587
Hey!

835
51:15.787 --> 51:16.787
Get out.

836
51:17.217 --> 51:18.517
I don't want to talk to you, so get out.

837
51:19.157 --> 51:20.157
Hey.

838
51:20.657 --> 51:22.787
Don't ever contact me again.

839
51:23.427 --> 51:26.097
- Jang Hoon Tae. - Delete my number.

840
51:26.497 --> 51:27.627
Delete it right now in front of me.

841
51:27.967 --> 51:30.367
You think I won't delete it if you tell me to?

842
51:30.427 --> 51:31.637
- Delete it. - I'm deleting it.

843
51:32.097 --> 51:34.167
- Don't ever contact me again. - I'll delete it.

844
51:34.237 --> 51:35.237
Unbelievable.

845
51:50.787 --> 51:51.817
Oh my.

846
52:01.667 --> 52:03.367
Is this enough for you?

847
52:03.497 --> 52:06.867
- I even received pretty flowers. - No.

848
52:06.967 --> 52:08.507
Tteokbokki is my favourite.

849
52:10.407 --> 52:12.437
I'll buy you meat next time.

850
52:12.737 --> 52:14.647
I work part-time at a barbecue restaurant these days,

851
52:14.847 --> 52:16.777
and the meat there is really good.

852
52:17.647 --> 52:19.717
Yes, please buy me meat next time.

853
52:21.717 --> 52:22.717
Oh, right.

854
52:23.817 --> 52:27.087
By the way, is this yours?

855
52:27.317 --> 52:29.557
I was looking for it for a while.

856
52:30.087 --> 52:31.097
Thank you.

857
52:34.667 --> 52:37.867
- Please, have some tteokbokki. - Oh, right.

858
52:39.497 --> 52:40.497
Thank you.

859
52:40.897 --> 52:41.907
Water, too.

860
52:43.567 --> 52:45.037
Eat up.

861
52:48.307 --> 52:49.307
Thank you for the food.

862
53:03.027 --> 53:04.027
I'm sorry.

863
53:05.427 --> 53:07.297
Did I stare at you too much?

864
53:08.067 --> 53:09.067
No.

865
53:12.667 --> 53:14.097
Your parents must feel full...

866
53:14.667 --> 53:17.407
just by breathing the air, having a son like you.

867
53:22.247 --> 53:24.877
I don't know about my father since I never asked him,

868
53:25.247 --> 53:27.617
and my mother probably doesn't care.

869
53:31.457 --> 53:33.757
Before I even turned three, she left home.

870
53:34.357 --> 53:35.687
She had an affair with some man.

871
53:38.997 --> 53:40.627
So I don't even know what my mother looks like.

872
53:45.337 --> 53:46.867
I'm sorry.

873
53:47.767 --> 53:49.767
I shouldn't have brought it up.

874
53:50.767 --> 53:51.777
It's fine.

875
54:01.587 --> 54:03.787
Are you okay?

876
54:04.657 --> 54:06.057
Oh my.

877
54:09.087 --> 54:13.357
Breathe slowly, slowly. Are you okay?

878
54:14.897 --> 54:17.227
Oh my. I'm sorry.

879
54:19.697 --> 54:21.237
Drink some water. Okay?

880
54:29.847 --> 54:32.617
(Father)

881
54:33.517 --> 54:37.047
You must never lose Kim Mu Jin.

882
54:37.487 --> 54:40.617
That guy Kim Mu Jin is the real deal.

883
54:40.857 --> 54:44.357
I confirmed everything today, so don't push him away...

884
54:44.427 --> 54:46.397
saying you aren't good enough for him.

885
54:46.597 --> 54:50.327
Don't run away, and hold onto him. Like a fly on a sticky trap,

886
54:50.797 --> 54:53.997
- you have to stick to him. - Father, I have a customer.

887
54:54.237 --> 54:55.237
I'm hanging up.

888
54:58.907 --> 54:59.907
Eat this.

889
55:00.307 --> 55:02.677
My mom said she wanted to eat hotteok,

890
55:03.077 --> 55:04.677
and she thought you'd still be at the store,

891
55:04.817 --> 55:06.677
- so she told me to bring you one. - Thanks, Heung Sik.

892
55:06.747 --> 55:07.747
I'll enjoy it.

893
55:10.947 --> 55:11.987
You know your father...

894
55:12.557 --> 55:15.157
He is completely blown away by Kim Mu Jin.

895
55:16.187 --> 55:18.297
I mean, your father told me to come out,

896
55:18.357 --> 55:19.997
so we went to Kim Mu Jin's restaurant together.

897
55:22.027 --> 55:25.297
And honestly, he is a much better guy than I thought.

898
55:26.567 --> 55:27.767
It seems like Kim Mu Jin...

899
55:28.637 --> 55:31.407
wants to start over with you,

900
55:31.677 --> 55:34.847
so stop running away and just say yes. Okay?

901
55:35.107 --> 55:36.207
If you lose Kim Mu Jin,

902
55:36.407 --> 55:38.617
you will never meet someone like him again.

903
55:39.117 --> 55:40.477
Why are you acting like this too?

904
55:41.947 --> 55:43.117
He and I are not meant to be.

905
55:43.687 --> 55:44.687
It is absolutely impossible.

906
55:44.757 --> 55:48.587
- It is impossible. - What is impossible about it?

907
55:49.287 --> 55:52.027
They say love even crosses borders.

908
55:52.327 --> 55:54.027
I would rather cross a border.

909
55:54.967 --> 55:56.597
But Kim Mu Jin and I are not happening.

910
55:57.527 --> 55:58.567
Absolutely not.

911
55:59.137 --> 56:01.267
I mean, what, is Kim Mu Jin...

912
56:01.337 --> 56:03.037
the only son of a conglomerate family or something?

913
56:03.237 --> 56:05.107
If he were the only son of a conglomerate family,

914
56:05.177 --> 56:08.577
I would definitely stop you too. It is obvious you would suffer...

915
56:08.647 --> 56:10.647
if you married into a family like that.

916
56:10.707 --> 56:13.547
I would follow you around and stop you myself.

917
56:17.747 --> 56:21.187
He is the only son of a conglomerate family.

918
56:22.157 --> 56:24.697
- He just has one older sister. - Oh, come on.

919
56:24.757 --> 56:27.057
Stop joking around.

920
56:30.267 --> 56:32.467
I am telling you, he is the only son of a conglomerate family.

921
56:33.297 --> 56:34.297
Kim Mu Jin.

922
56:38.507 --> 56:39.637
Are you serious?

923
56:43.677 --> 56:44.777
Because of me,

924
56:45.817 --> 56:47.647
he threw away everything he had,

925
56:49.447 --> 56:52.117
turned his back on his family, and left his home.

926
56:54.587 --> 56:55.687
I am...

927
56:56.857 --> 56:58.157
not going to Kim Mu Jin.

928
57:02.027 --> 57:03.727
I will make him give up no matter what.

929
57:06.867 --> 57:08.167
I will make him get sick of me,

930
57:09.137 --> 57:10.337
lose all his feelings,

931
57:12.677 --> 57:15.777
and run away without looking back.

932
57:17.747 --> 57:19.317
I am definitely going to make that happen.

933
57:34.727 --> 57:36.727
(Suragan Side Dishes)

934
57:39.297 --> 57:41.297
(Hamheung Cold Noodles)

935
57:48.277 --> 57:49.277
What is all this?

936
57:50.177 --> 57:51.177
What is what?

937
57:52.247 --> 57:54.047
You said you would not even look in the direction of our house.

938
57:54.787 --> 57:56.417
Is there no cold noodle restaurant near your house?

939
57:56.517 --> 57:57.887
No, there is not. What are you going to do about it?

940
57:59.957 --> 58:01.087
You have a problem, do you not?

941
58:01.427 --> 58:03.727
If you think it is not working out, quitting early is also an answer.

942
58:03.957 --> 58:06.697
You are not exactly close with patience or endurance anyway.

943
58:06.957 --> 58:08.057
Why would I quit?

944
58:08.127 --> 58:09.627
Do you know how happy I am right now?

945
58:09.767 --> 58:10.867
Even today, I received diamond earrings...

946
58:10.927 --> 58:12.437
from my mother-in-law.

947
58:12.697 --> 58:14.537
Then you should be chewing on those diamond earrings.

948
58:14.737 --> 58:16.867
Why come to our neighbourhood to eat cold noodles?

949
58:18.277 --> 58:19.437
If you tell Father and Han Gyu Rim...

950
58:19.507 --> 58:21.977
- that I am here, you are dead. - Do not worry.

951
58:22.307 --> 58:23.747
Our family does not even bring you up.

952
58:23.807 --> 58:25.617
- Because it ruins our appetite. - What did you say, you jerk?

953
58:26.077 --> 58:27.417
I have stayed long enough, right?

954
58:27.777 --> 58:29.787
- I am leaving. - Wait.

955
58:33.257 --> 58:34.757
Check your messages. I sent you a photo.

956
58:39.757 --> 58:40.827
What is this?

957
58:41.467 --> 58:42.467
My mother-in-law.

958
58:42.927 --> 58:44.697
Why are you sending me a photo of your mother-in-law?

959
58:48.507 --> 58:50.367
Memorize her face and avoid her.

960
58:51.167 --> 58:52.177
What?

961
58:52.537 --> 58:54.577
She might end up as your client,

962
58:54.637 --> 58:56.847
so you need to be smart and avoid her.

963
58:57.677 --> 58:59.517
If she unluckily takes an interest in you,

964
58:59.947 --> 59:01.377
our family tree will get completely messed up.

965
59:01.717 --> 59:02.717
Got it?

966
59:06.857 --> 59:08.827
- Hey! - If you are a human being,

967
59:09.887 --> 59:11.427
if you are really my sister,

968
59:12.097 --> 59:13.557
you should tell me to quit doing that.

969
59:13.897 --> 59:15.727
You should tell me to stop doing crazy things...

970
59:16.097 --> 59:17.627
and work honestly and sweat for a living.

971
59:17.697 --> 59:18.737
You are seriously...

972
59:23.537 --> 59:25.177
If you ever see me on the street,

973
59:25.677 --> 59:26.837
you better avoid me.

974
59:27.437 --> 59:30.107
If I ever see you again, I do not know what I might do.

975
59:36.187 --> 59:37.217
Darn it.

976
59:43.427 --> 59:45.527
It is hot. Why is it so hot?

977
59:46.297 --> 59:48.827
Sir, please turn on the air conditioner.

978
01:00:05.547 --> 01:00:06.577
Gyu Oh.

979
01:00:12.717 --> 01:00:13.717
Han Gyu Oh.

980
01:00:16.927 --> 01:00:18.027
Yes, Gyu Rim.

981
01:00:20.257 --> 01:00:22.427
What are you thinking about so deeply?

982
01:00:23.997 --> 01:00:25.267
Nothing, just...

983
01:00:27.337 --> 01:00:30.837
I was just wondering what is in that bag you are holding.

984
01:00:32.207 --> 01:00:35.507
This? Hotteok. Heung Sik gave them to me.

985
01:00:36.777 --> 01:00:39.247
Gyu Seo absolutely loves hotteok.

986
01:00:39.717 --> 01:00:40.717
I know, right?

987
01:00:41.547 --> 01:00:44.317
You should share these with Gyu Seo. Do not fight over them.

988
01:00:45.017 --> 01:00:46.017
Got it.

989
01:00:46.217 --> 01:00:47.887
I will share them nicely without fighting.

990
01:00:49.227 --> 01:00:51.227
- Let us go. - Did you dump him again today?

991
01:00:52.097 --> 01:00:53.097
Kim Mu Jin.

992
01:00:55.527 --> 01:00:56.927
You kicked him out again?

993
01:00:57.497 --> 01:00:58.697
Are you Son Heung Min or something?

994
01:01:01.607 --> 01:01:03.037
Who said anything?

995
01:01:06.607 --> 01:01:07.707
Mu Jin and I decided...

996
01:01:08.577 --> 01:01:09.647
to be close brothers.

997
01:01:12.247 --> 01:01:13.547
Did you meet Mu Jin?

998
01:01:15.217 --> 01:01:16.217
Did you also...

999
01:01:17.047 --> 01:01:18.317
meet Mu Jin?

1000
01:01:19.257 --> 01:01:20.857
Stop kicking my brother like that.

1001
01:01:21.657 --> 01:01:24.727
Your legs are so strong, it hurts a lot when you kick.

1002
01:01:26.697 --> 01:01:28.627
If you want to kick someone, kick me instead.

1003
01:01:29.767 --> 01:01:32.167
Got it, Gyu Rim? I am counting on you.

1004
01:01:32.897 --> 01:01:34.097
I am trusting you on this.

1005
01:01:43.807 --> 01:01:46.617
So stop pushing him away and stop running away.

1006
01:01:47.077 --> 01:01:51.617
I think fate is using me as a bridge to get you and Mu Jin back together.

1007
01:01:52.157 --> 01:01:54.887
He is a man that my mom and I really like.

1008
01:01:55.357 --> 01:01:58.657
Kim Mu Jin, that guy is the real deal.

1009
01:01:59.327 --> 01:02:01.397
Stop kicking my brother like that.

1010
01:02:38.327 --> 01:02:39.337
What?

1011
01:02:44.407 --> 01:02:45.437
What now?

1012
01:02:46.407 --> 01:02:47.577
Go outside.

1013
01:02:49.047 --> 01:02:51.677
- Why? What is it? - Gyu Rim is...

1014
01:02:53.417 --> 01:02:54.617
I think she is crazy.

1015
01:02:55.217 --> 01:02:56.317
What are you talking about?

1016
01:02:58.957 --> 01:03:01.587
Considering how much you hate tigers and how scared you are of them.

1017
01:03:02.127 --> 01:03:03.127
What?

1018
01:03:24.977 --> 01:03:26.377
Where is Gyu Rim?

1019
01:03:34.387 --> 01:03:35.427
Mu Jin.

1020
01:04:02.587 --> 01:04:03.787
It's me, Gyu Rim.

1021
01:04:44.887 --> 01:04:46.797
(Love on the Menu)

1022
01:04:46.857 --> 01:04:47.997
Gyu Rim is acting weird.

1023
01:04:48.057 --> 01:04:50.527
- Really, really weird. - This is who I really am.

1024
01:04:50.597 --> 01:04:52.297
I'm even crazier than Han Gyu Young

1025
01:04:52.367 --> 01:04:53.397
I'm not getting a divorce.

1026
01:04:53.467 --> 01:04:55.407
- Gyu Young. - Let's not get a divorce...

1027
01:04:55.467 --> 01:04:56.967
and just date other people on our own.

1028
01:04:57.037 --> 01:04:58.367
What is she talking about?

1029
01:04:58.437 --> 01:05:00.137
I didn't know anything for eight years.

1030
01:05:00.477 --> 01:05:03.847
- I didn't know anything. - Mom, is your goal...

1031
01:05:04.047 --> 01:05:05.477
to get rejected by Mu Jin?

1032
01:05:05.617 --> 01:05:06.747
If it were me, I'd be so turned off...

1033
01:05:06.817 --> 01:05:07.847
that I wouldn't want to see her again.

1034
01:05:07.917 --> 01:05:09.017
This is a bit annoying.

1035
01:05:09.147 --> 01:05:10.247
I just thought she was cute and pretty.

1036
01:05:10.317 --> 01:05:12.117
This is such a turnoff.
